                                                "sense_id": "c12cb681-5a1c-3538-b1a2-5850ae01860e",
                                                "text": "But this thou hast, that thou hatest the deeds of the Nicolaitans, which also I hate....So hast thou also them that hold to the doctrine of the Nicolaitans."
